Cell["\<\
\"wcc\" -> {{1/3,2/3,0},{2/3,1/3,0}} explicitly supplies the two graphene \
orbital centers in the row and column order of grapheneHamiltonian. Use this \
form to convert a user-supplied Hamiltonian that was not built by the current \
init session:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"42b060a5-a0a5-4cfa-92f9-81efc57151be"],

